<div data-controller="modal"
     class="fixed inset-0 z-50 flex items-center justify-center p-4"
     style="background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6);">
  <div data-modal-target="content"
       class="w-full max-w-md max-h-[90vh] overflow-y-auto rounded-xl shadow-2xl p-6"
       style="background-color: var(--color-bg-secondary);">
    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2">환영합니다! 🎉</h2>
    <p class="text-sm mb-4" style="color: var(--color-text-secondary);">
      기본 카테고리가 자동으로 생성되었습니다. 카테고리를 자유롭게 수정하세요.
    </p>

    <div class="space-y-2 mb-6">
      <% current_user.categories.each do |category| %>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-2 rounded-lg"
             style="background-color: var(--color-bg-tertiary);">
          <span style="color: <%= category.color || '#a3a3a3' %>;"><%= lucide_icon(category.icon, size: 20) %></span>
          <span class="text-sm"><%= category.name %></span>
        </div>
      <% end %>
    </div>

    <div class="flex gap-3">
      <button data-action="modal#close"
              class="flex-1 py-2 rounded-lg text-sm"
              style="background-color: var(--color-bg-tertiary); color: var(--color-text-secondary);">
        건너뛰기
      </button>
      <%= link_to "카테고리 관리",
          categories_path,
          class: "flex-1 py-2 rounded-lg text-sm font-bold text-center",
          style: "background-color: var(--color-accent); color: var(--color-text-primary);" %>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
